+    adoptable against old-ne by the rule as written, which has no clean-word guard.
+  - SW, control:
+    - fails M2 by -0.0142 (noise 0.0136) and the clean-word guard by -0.072 (noise 0.049);
+    - passes M1a, M1b, M1c (+0.001) and the audit.
